cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software version and the original datasets when using BiFAN."
title: "BiFAN: additive fusion of protein language representations and physicochemical descriptors for antimicrobial peptide prediction"
abstract: >-
  BiFAN combines fine-tuned ESM-2 representations with 559 composition and
  physicochemical descriptors through additive fusion for binary AMP prediction.
  This version includes training and prediction code, baseline implementations,
  fixed data splits, and reported aggregate results.
type: software
